ve'=>'移除','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'已由更新的插件版本保存：请更新此插件，或重新输入密钥。','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'无法再打开已保存的密钥（站点的安全密钥已更改）。请重新输入。','Not connected'=>'未连接','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'已连接 — 上次测试通过时间：%s','Last test failed: %s'=>'上次测试失败：%s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'已连接 — 尚未测试','Which model to use'=>'使用哪个模型','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ 表示我们针对该任务的推荐。该列表包含您的密钥可使用的所有模型，直接从提供商实时读取。','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— 推荐用于提供商 —','Save models'=>'保存模型','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'从提供商处刷新模型列表','Images'=>'图像','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'连接 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 以生成图像。','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— 首个已连接提供商的最新图像模型 —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'站内搜索（嵌入向量）','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'连接 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或 OpenRouter 以构建您网站的搜索索引。','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— 首个连接的提供商的最新嵌入模型 —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'更改此项会重建使用它的每个插件的搜索索引。','best quality'=>'最佳质量','lowest cost'=>'最低成本','fastest'=>'最快','Add a model yourself'=>'自行添加模型','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'今天有新模型发布吗？请粘贴其确切名称即可立即使用。','Model name'=>'模型名称','Add model'=>'添加模型','Recommended models list'=>'推荐模型列表','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'无法验证推荐模型列表，因此未显示任何推荐。请重新安装插件，或在下方开启每日更新。','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'正在使用的列表已于 %s 发布。每次插件更新都会带来全新列表。','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'另请每天检查一次 Zinn Digital® 以获取更新的列表。','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'仅发送普通的下载请求：没有密钥，没有站点地址，没有任何关于您的内容的信息。该列表已签名，未通过签名验证的列表将被忽略。','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'上次检查于 %1$s：%2$s。','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'保存，若已开启请立即检查','a newer list was installed'=>'已安装较新的列表','already up to date'=>'已是最新版本','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'下载未通过签名检查，已被忽略','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'无法连接至 Zinn Digital®；继续使用当前列表','turned off'=>'已关闭','Open'=>'打开','Check their status page'=>'查看他们的状态页面','Open your billing page'=>'打开您的账单页面','Open your API keys page'=>'打开您的 API 密钥页面','Open the AI settings'=>'打开 AI 设置','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'抱歉，您无权执行此操作。','Unknown provider.'=>'未知提供商。','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'请输入您的服务地址，例如 http://localhost:11434/v1。','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'这看起来不像是 API 密钥。请重新复制，不要包含空格。','Paste your API key first.'=>'请先粘贴您的 API 密钥。','Key removed.'=>'密钥已移除。','Models saved.'=>'模型已保存。','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'请输入模型的确切名称，例如提供商文档中所写的名称。','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'已添加 %s。请在“使用哪个模型”下进行选择。','Model removed.'=>'模型已移除。','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'每日更新已关闭。正在使用插件自带的列表。','Checked: %s.'=>'已检查：%s。','Model lists refreshed.'=>'模型列表已刷新。','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'您的 AI 密钥已由您的其中一个插件的较新版本保存。请更新此插件，或在 AI 设置中重新输入该密钥。','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'您保存的 AI 密钥已无法打开（站点的安全密钥已更改）。请在 AI 设置中重新输入。','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI 尚未设置。请在 AI 设置中为 AI 提供商添加密钥。','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'未为此任务选择模型。请在 AI 设置中选择一个。','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'该版本的插件不支持该 AI 提供商。','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'未连接可以生成图像的 AI 提供商。请在 AI 设置中添加 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini 密钥。','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'此 AI 提供商无法生成图像。请在 AI 设置中为图像选择 OpenAI 或 Google Gemini。','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'您的 AI 密钥无法使用任何图像模型。请向提供商检查该密钥的权限，或选择其他图像提供商。','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'没有已连接的 AI 提供商可以构建搜索索引。请在 AI 设置中添加 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或 OpenRouter 密钥。','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'您的 AI 密钥无法使用任何嵌入（embedding）模型。请向提供商核对该密钥的权限，或为网站搜索选择其他提供商。','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'此 AI 提供商无法构建搜索索引。请连接 Google Gemini、OpenAI、Mistral 或兼容的服务以进行站点搜索。','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'此站点无法连接到您的 AI 服务。请检查该服务是否正在运行，以及其地址是否可以从您的 Web 服务器访问（无法从托管站点访问您本地计算机上的服务）。','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'本站点无法连接至 %s。请检查其状态页面；如果其正常运行，则可能是您的主机服务商阻止了外发连接，或者地址有误。','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s 显示您的账户已无剩余额度或配额。请在对方平台的账户中充值或提高额度，然后重试。','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s 未接受您的密钥。它可能拼写有误、已被撤销或已过期。请创建一个新密钥并粘贴在此处。','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s 拒绝了针对您密钥的此请求。该密钥可能无权访问此模型或功能，或者您的账户需要验证。','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'模型“%1$s”在 %2$s 中不可用于您的密钥。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型。','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'您的 %2$s 方案不包含模型“%1$s”。请在 AI 设置中选择其他模型，或向他们升级您的方案。','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s 正在限制您的密钥发送请求的频率。请稍候一分钟再试，或者提高您在他们那里的速率限制。','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s 目前遇到问题（其服务端出现中断或过载）。您的设置没有问题。请稍后重试。','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'AI 请求因未知原因失败。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请携带以下详细信息联系支持团队。','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'AI 提供商返回了此插件无法读取的格式。请重试；如果问题仍然存在，请选择其他模型或联系支持团队。','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'自定义（兼容 OpenAI）','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'请先为此提供商保存密钥。','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'您的密钥有效，但提供商未列出适用的文本模型。请在下方自行添加模型。','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'已连接。%1$s 已使用 %2$s 作出回应。您的 AI 功能已可供使用。','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的用户角色无权在此站点上使用 AI。请咨询管理员。','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'本站点已达到每月 AI 支出上限。管理员可在 AI 设置中提高此上限。','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'本站点已达到其每月 AI 请求限制。管理员可以在 AI 设置中提高此限制。','Usage and cost'=>'用量与费用','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'日志、限制和角色权限适用于通过以下方式使用的 AI：%s。','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'费用为近似估算值，根据公布的价格计算得出；价格未知的模型计为零。','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'本月：%1$s 次请求，大约 %2$s。','When'=>'时间','Who'=>'操作者','Used for'=>'用于','Model'=>'型号','Tokens in / out'=>'输入 / 输出 Token','About'=>'关于','Result'=>'结果','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'尚未发出任何 AI 请求。','Done'=>'完成','Limits and permissions'=>'限制与权限','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'每月支出限额（US 美元）','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'留空表示不设限制。一旦近似费用达到此限额，AI 将在本月剩余时间内停止运行。','Monthly request limit'=>'每月请求限制','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'留空表示无限制。','Who may use AI'=>'谁可以使用 AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'请勿勾选任何项，以允许所有可以使用插件功能的人使用 AI。管理员始终可以使用它。','Save limits and permissions'=>'保存限制与权限','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'限制和权限已保存。','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'该语言不是本站点的语言之一。','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'翻译必须是与原文相同类型的内容。','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'请选择该站点的其他语言之一。','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'此插件副本中缺少管理屏幕脚本。请从已发布的安装包中重新安装。','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'此屏幕需要 JavaScript。','Choose a language'=>'选择语言','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'虚拟主机客户？获取 %2$s 的 %1$d%% 折扣','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'作为 Zinn Digital® 托管客户，您可获得用于首次付款立减 %d%% 的专属代码。续费按正常价格收取。','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'获取我的 %d%% 优惠码并前往结账','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'此折扣适用于拥有状态良好的付费主机托管计划的客户。免费试用不符合条件。','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'您已将您的托管客户折扣用于此插件。','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'我们刚才无法获取您的验证码。请在几分钟后重试。','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'前缀必须为 1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，以字母开头，且不得包含插件名称。','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'“%s”不是语言代码。请使用 fr_FR 或 de_DE 等 WordPress 区域设置。','List at least one language.'=>'请列出至少一种语言。','Translations'=>'翻译','Edit the %s version'=>'编辑 %s 版本','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'并排比较 %s 版本','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Alternative text'=>'替代文本','Caption'=>'说明','Title'=>'标题','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'请为每种语言选择您的一个菜单。','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'请先保存此文章，然后再在此处翻译。','This one'=>'这一个','Edit'=>'编辑','Side by side'=>'并排','Translate again'=>'重新翻译','Translate'=>'翻译','Create a copy to translate by hand'=>'创建副本以手动翻译','Translate uses the engine set for that language. A version a person edited is never overwritten.'=>'翻译使用为该语言设置的引擎。人工编辑的版本绝不会被覆盖。','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'您无权翻译此项目。','%s: translated.'=>'%s：已翻译。','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'这不是翻译，因此没有什么需要保护的内容。','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'此类内容不进行翻译。','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'文本 %s 已不再存在于本站点。请重新加载页面。','No translation engine could take this text.'=>'没有翻译引擎可以接受此文本。','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'请选择您的其他语言之一。','Compare translation'=>'比较翻译','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'您无权编辑此翻译。','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'这不是翻译，因此无可比内容。','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'此翻译的原文已不存在。','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'片段 %s 不再是此翻译的一部分。请重新加载页面并重试。','Translate on this page'=>'在此页面上翻译','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'该项目已有该语言的版本。','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'该翻译引擎在此站点上不可用。','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'针对每种语言使用不同的引擎、自动回退机制以及支出上限均为 Tranzly Pro 功能。','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'每种语言的首选翻译和语气是 Tranzly Pro 的功能。不翻译列表是免费的。','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'%s 的值不是允许的选项之一。','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'此站点上后台队列不可用。','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'翻译任务以启动该任务的人员身份运行，因此用户必须处于登录状态。','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'在该选定内容中，没有允许您翻译的内容。','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'该项目不属于翻译任务的一部分。','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'您无权更改该翻译。','Tranzly is not set up on this site.'=>'Tranzly 尚未在此站点上设置。','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'此项目的群组已包含 %1$s 版本（#%2$d）。','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'项目不能是其自身的翻译。','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'该项目已是其他内容的翻译。请先取消关联。','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'无法保存翻译链接。','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'该文本无法在此处翻译。','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'该媒体文本无法在此处翻译。','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'翻译可以发布或保留为草稿。','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'您无权发布此类内容。','This item is already written in that language.'=>'该项目已使用该语言编写。','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'此翻译已由人工编辑（或导入），因此受到保护。请将其解锁以重新翻译。','That item does not exist.'=>'该项目不存在。','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'尚未设置翻译引擎。请在 Tranzly → Engines 中添加一个引擎的密钥。','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'该翻译引擎尚未设置：请先添加其密钥。','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'相同的文本目前正由另一个任务翻译；此项目将使用该结果。','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'没有任何翻译引擎能够处理此项目。','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'引擎未返回此项目所有部分的翻译。未进行任何更改。','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'每种语言都必须是站点的语言之一，并且具有可用的引擎。','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'备用列表只能指定可用的引擎。','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'每月上限是适用于可用引擎的以 US 美元为单位的金额，为零或更大值。','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'词汇表词条必须按网站的其中一种语言进行分组。','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'语气按网站语言设置：默认的正式程度，或多或少，外加可选说明。','AI model'=>'AI 模型','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'AI 模型 (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s目前出现问题。请稍后重试，或使用其他引擎。','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'您的站点无法访问 %s。请检查其是否可以建立出站连接，然后重试。','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s 未接受您的 API 密钥。请在 Tranzly → Engines 中检查该密钥。','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'您的 %s 账户已用尽配额或余额。请向其充值，或使用其他引擎。','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s要求我们放慢速度。系统将自动重试。','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'此文本过长，%s无法一次处理。请拆分内容，或使用其他引擎。','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s 拒绝翻译此内容。请尝试其他引擎，或手动进行翻译。','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s 不翻译此语言。请为其选择另一个引擎。','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'已达到 %s 本月的支出上限，因此未再向其发送任何内容。请在 Tranzly → Engines 中提高上限，或等到下个月。','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly c