ookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'在首次访问后%s追踪 Cookie，以最大化收益潜力。','Affiliation'=>'附属关系','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'您的许可证过期后，您仍然可以使用免费版本，但您将无法使用 %s 功能。','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'您的许可证过期后，您将无法再使用 %s，除非您使用有效的高级许可证再次激活它。','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'您仍然可以享用所有 %1$s 功能，但您将无法获取 %2$s 安全与功能更新，也无法获得支持服务。','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'感谢您的升级。','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'在您的免费 %1$s 结束后，低至 %2$s 即可享用','Agree & Activate License'=>'同意并激活许可证','I Agree - Change User'=>'我同意 - 更改用户','All Requests'=>'所有请求','All Types'=>'所有类型','allow'=>'允许','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'您已选择加入我们的使用情况跟踪，这有助于我们不断改进 %s。','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'您已选择加入我们的使用情况跟踪，这有助于我们不断改进它们。','Amount'=>'金额','as once a yearAnnual'=>'按年','as once a yearAnnually'=>'每年','Anonymous feedback'=>'匿名反馈','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'应用到网络中的所有站点。','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'应用于所有待处理的站点。','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'申请成为分销推广伙伴','Approve & Start Trial'=>'批准并开始试用','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'请告诉我们原因，以便我们进行改进。','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'在下方输入您用于升级的电子邮件地址，我们将重新向您发送许可证密钥。','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'请输入您在购买时使用的电子邮件地址，我们将向您重新发送许可证密钥。','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'关联到许可证所有者的账户。','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'作者','Invalid module ID.'=>'无效的模块 ID。','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'您没有有效的许可证来访问高级版本。','Auto instal