在 %2$s 的邮箱中收到一封关于 %1$s 的确认电子邮件。请确保点击该电子邮件中的按钮以%3$s。','days'=>'天','deactivating'=>'正在停用','hour'=>'小时','hours'=>'小时','license'=>'许可证','optional'=>'可选','products'=>'产品','skip'=>'跳过','subscription'=>'订阅','trial'=>'试用','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'产品','as activating pluginActivating'=>'正在激活','as software licenseLicense'=>'许可证','close a windowDismiss'=>'忽略','close windowDismiss'=>'忽略','like websitesSites'=>'站点','nounPricing'=>'定价','trial periodTrial'=>'试用','verbOpt In'=>'选择加入','verbOpt Out'=>'选择退出','verbSkip'=>'跳过','verbUpgrade'=>'升级','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s前','Blocks with repeated items, and synced patterns'=>'包含重复项目的区块，以及已同步的样板','WooCommerce products'=>'WooCommerce 产品','Comments and reviews'=>'评论与评价','Translated automatically from %s.'=>'从 %s 自动翻译。','WooCommerce currencies'=>'WooCommerce 货币','Currency'=>'货币','The rate source does not quote %s, the shop\'s currency.'=>'汇率来源未报出商店所使用的货币 %s。','"%s" is not a currency WooCommerce knows, or it is the shop\'s own currency.'=>'“%s” 不是 WooCommerce 识别的货币，或者是商店本身的货币。','Enter a rate above zero for %s, like 0.92.'=>'为 %s 输入大于零的汇率，例如 0.92。','Rounding steps and price endings are amounts, like 0.05 or 0.99.'=>'舍入步长和价格尾数是金额，例如 0.05 或 0.99。','Custom fields (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)'=>'自定义字段 (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)','Choose translate, copy or leave empty for each field.'=>'请为每个字段选择翻译、复制或留空。','Forms (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)'=>'表单 (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)','I enter the rates myself'=>'我自己输入费率','European Central Bank, updated daily (free, no account needed)'=>'欧洲中央银行，每日更新（免费，无需账户）','The European Central Bank answered %d. The last rates are kept.'=>'欧洲中央银行回复了 %d。最新的利率维持不变。','The European Central Bank\'s feed held no rates. The last rates are kept.'=>'欧洲中央银行的信息源未包含汇率。系统已保留最后的汇率。','That exchange-rate source is not available.'=>'该汇率源不可用。','SEO plugins (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)'=>'SEO 插件（Yoast SEO、Rank Math、SEOPress、All in One SEO）','Theme and plugin text'=>'主题和插件文本','That theme or plugin is not active on this site.'=>'该主题或插件未在此站点上启用。','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'该操作无法完成。请重试，如果仍然失败，请联系网站管理员。','Connect an AI app'=>'连接 AI 应用','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'此连接请求已过期。请返回该应用程序并重新开始连接。','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s 申请在此站点上以 %3$s 的身份使用 %2$s。它只能执行您的 WordPress 帐户有权执行的操作，并且您可以随时在 AI 代理 (MCP) 设置中将其断开连接。','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s已从%2$s识别自身。','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s 已自动注册。仅当您是从 %2$s 发起此操作时才继续。','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'您的账户不能在此站点上使用这些工具。请咨询管理员。','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'回答后您将返回%s。','Allow %s'=>'允许 %s','Do not allow'=>'不允许','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'缺少必填值或格式错误。请检查该能力的输入架构。','The site refused the request.'=>'网站拒绝了该请求。','AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI 智能体 (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'让 Claude、Cursor 或 VS Code 等 AI 助手通过 MCP（模型上下文协议）为您操作此站点。它们以 WordPress 用户的身份登录（Claude 和 ChatGPT 通过在此处进行授权，其他助手则使用应用程序密码），并且只能执行该用户被允许执行的操作。','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'AI 代理需要 WordPress 6.9 或更高版本。请更新 WordPress 以使用它们。','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'允许 AI 代理 (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'关闭：以下工具及其 REST 路由完全未注册。','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'连接地址 (MCP 端点)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude 和 ChatGPT：改为登录','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'将连接地址作为自定义连接器添加到 Claude 中，或在 ChatGPT 开发者模式中作为应用程序添加。它们会打开此网站以便您批准；无需复制密码。','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'已连接到您账户的 AI 应用程序：','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'其他 AI 应用程序：应用程序密码','Create an application password for your user'=>'为您的用户创建应用程序密码','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'请将此内容以及您的用户名和该密码添加到您的 AI 应用的 MCP 设置中：','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code：将相同的条目放在 .vscode/mcp.json 中的 "servers" 下，而不是放在 "mcpServers" 下。','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'AI 代理在此可以使用的工具 (%d)：','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'用户指南：AI 智能体与 MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'开发者文档：能力、REST 和 MCP','Translate this site\'s content and check its translations with Tranzly.'=>'翻译此网站的内容并使用 Tranzly 检查其翻译。','Languages, translation and translation status.'=>'语言、翻译与翻译状态。','List languages'=>'列出语言','Lists the site\'s languages. The first one is the language the original content is written in.'=>'列出站点的各种语言。第一种是撰写原始内容所用的语言。','List translation engines'=>'列出翻译引擎','Lists the translation engines, whether each is set up, and which one is used when none is named.'=>'列出翻译引擎、各项引擎是否已设置，以及在未指定时使用哪一个引擎。','Translate a post or page'=>'翻译文章或页面','Translates one post or page into one or more of the site\'s languages with a translation engine, creating each translation or updating it. New translations are drafts unless publish is true. A translation a person edited is skipped unless force is true.'=>'使用翻译引擎将一篇文稿或页面翻译为网站的一种或多种语言，创建或更新各项翻译。除非 publish 为 true，否则新翻译均为草稿。除非 force 为 true，否则人工编辑过的翻译将被跳过。','Language codes from tranzly/list-languages, e.g. de_DE, or just de when only one German is listed.'=>'来自 tranzly/list-languages 的语言代码，例如 de_DE，或者在仅列出一种德语时仅使用 de。','An engine id from tranzly/list-engines; the default engine when omitted.'=>'来自 tranzly/list-engines 的引擎 ID；省略时使用默认引擎。','Translation status'=>'翻译状态','With a post ID: each language\'s translation of that post, whether it is out of date, and who wrote it. Without one: how much of the site is translated, per language.'=>'附带文章 ID：该文章在各种语言下的翻译、是否已过时以及作者是谁。不带文章 ID：每种语言下网站的已翻译比例。','Translate my site'=>'翻译我的网站','A guided workflow: the agent checks the languages and engine, estimates the cost, and translates what is missing, asking before it spends or publishes.'=>'引导式工作流：代理会检查语言和引擎、预估费用并翻译缺失的内容，在产生费用或发布之前会先征询您的许可。','The languages to translate into, e.g. German and French.'=>'要翻译成的语言，例如德语和法语。','Translate this WordPress site into: %s. Steps: 1) call tranzly-list-languages; if a language is missing, ask me before adding it with tranzly-update-settings; 2) call tranzly-list-engines and make sure one is set up (otherwise tell me which key to add); 3) call tranzly-translation-status for the whole site and tranzly-estimate for what is missing, and tell me the cost before spending anything; 4) after I agree, translate with tranzly-bulk-translate if it is available (Pro), otherwise post by post with tranzly-translate-post; 5) new translations stay drafts unless I say to publish; 6) finish with tranzly-translation-status and list what is still missing.'=>'将此 WordPress 网站翻译为：%s。步骤：1) 调用 tranzly-list-languages；如果缺少某种语言，在使用 tranzly-update-settings 添加之前请先询问我；2) 调用 tranzly-list-engines 并确保已配置一个引擎（否则请告知我需要添加哪个密钥）；3) 为整个网站调用 tranzly-translation-status 并针对缺失内容调用 tranzly-estimate，在产生任何费用前向我告知成本；4) 在我同意后，如果可用（Pro）请使用 tranzly-bulk-translate 进行翻译，否则使用 tranzly-translate-post 逐篇翻译；5) 除非我要求发布，否则新翻译一律保留为草稿；6) 以 tranzly-translation-status 结束并列出仍然缺失的内容。','Name at least one language.'=>'请指定至少一种语言。','Read comment handling (Pro)'=>'阅读评论处理 (Pro)','Returns whether comments are shared across languages or kept per language.'=>'返回评论是在语言之间共享还是按每种语言单独保留。','Change comment handling (Pro)'=>'更改评论处理方式 (Pro)','Shares comments across a post\'s translations or keeps them per language (mode).'=>'在文章的各翻译版本之间共享评论，或按语言分别保留（模式）。','Read the display options'=>'阅读显示选项','Returns the language switcher and credit display options.'=>'返回语言切换器和制作人员名单显示选项。','Change the display options'=>'更改显示选项','Changes the switcher (style, flags, names, placement) and the credit line.'=>'更改切换器（样式、旗帜、名称、位置）和制作人员名单行。','Read the DeepL usage'=>'读取 DeepL 使用量','Returns the characters used and the limit of the saved DeepL key this month.'=>'返回本月已保存的 DeepL 密钥的使用字符数和上限。','Read the engine settings'=>'读取引擎设置','Returns the default and fallback engine, per-language engines, each engine\'s state and this month\'s spend.'=>'返回默认引擎与备用引擎、各语言专属引擎、各个引擎的状态以及本月的支出。','Change the engine settings'=>'更改引擎设置','Sets the default engine, a fallback engine and per-language engines (default, fallback, per_lang). Per-language engines and fallback are Pro.'=>'设置默认引擎、备用引擎以及按语言区分的引擎（default、fallback、per_lang）。按语言区分的引擎和备用引擎为 Pro 功能。','Save an engine key'=>'保存引擎密钥','Saves the API key (and region for Microsoft) of DeepL, Google or Microsoft; empty removes it. Keys are stored encrypted and never returned.'=>'保存 DeepL、Google 或 Microsoft 的 API 密钥（以及 Microsoft 的区域）；留空则将其移除。密钥以加密形式存储，且绝不会被返回。','Estimate a translation'=>'预估翻译','Estimates characters and cost to translate posts (posts or post_type) into languages (langs) with an engine, before spending anything.'=>'在产生任何花费之前，预估使用引擎将文章（posts 或 post_type）翻译为各种语言（langs）所需的字符数和费用。','Import a translated file (Pro)'=>'导入翻译后的文件 (Pro)','Uploads a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file (content, filename) translated elsewhere; answers a token for tranzly/import-translation-file.'=>'上传在别处翻译的 Tranzly XLIFF 或 CSV 文件（内容、文件名）；返回用于 tranzly/import-translation-file 的令牌。','List plugins to migrate from (Pro)'=>'列出要迁出的插件（Pro）','Lists WPML, Polylang and TranslatePress data found on this site that can be imported.'=>'列出此站点上找到的可以导入的 WPML、Polylang 和 TranslatePress 数据。','Migrate from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress (Pro)'=>'从 WPML、Polylang 或 TranslatePress (Pro) 迁移','Imports the next page of translations from another multilingual plugin (mode: dry-run or run; cursor).'=>'从另一个多语言插件导入下一页翻译（模式：dry-run 或 run；光标）。','Write an imported file (Pro)'=>'写入导入的文件 (Pro)','Writes the next page of posts from an uploaded translation file (repeat with after until done).'=>'从已上传的翻译文件中写入下一页文章（使用 after 重复此操作直至完成）。','Read the integrations'=>'阅读集成','Lists the SEO, WooCommerce, page-builder and form plugins Tranzly supports and which are active here.'=>'列出 Tranzly 支持且在此处处于活动状态的 SEO、WooCommerce、页面构建器和表单插件。','List translation jobs'=>'列出翻译任务','Lists background translation jobs, newest first, with progress.'=>'列出后台翻译任务，最新的排在最前，并显示进度。','Start a translation job'=>'启动翻译任务','Starts a background job translating listed posts (posts) or a whole post type into languages (langs).'=>'启动后台任务，将列出的文章 (posts) 或整个文章类型翻译为多种语言 (langs)。','Retry or hand off a failed item'=>'重试或转交失败的项','Retries a failed item (action: retry, optionally with another engine) or marks it for translating by hand (action: by-hand).'=>'重试失败的项目（操作：retry，可选择使用其他引擎）或将其标记为手动翻译（操作：by-hand）。','Read a job\'s progress'=>'读取作业进度','Returns one job\'s progress and counts.'=>'返回单个任务的进度和计数。','Cancel a job'=>'取消任务','Stops a job; translations already made are kept.'=>'停止任务；已完成的翻译将被保留。','Read a job\'s failures'=>'读取任务失败记录','Lists a job\'s failed items with the reason for each.'=>'列出作业失败的项目及其原因。','Read the licence'=>'阅读许可证','Returns this site\'s Tranzly plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'返回此站点的 Tranzly 方案、许可证状态、续订日期以及方案包含的内容。','Disconnect from support'=>'断开与支持团队的连接','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'断开此站点与支持的连接。','Read the support connection'=>'读取支持连接','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'说明此站点是否已连接到 Zinn Digital® 支持，以及以何身份连接。','Connect to support'=>'连接至支持团队','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'将此站点连接到 Zinn Digital® 支持（姓名、电子邮件、同意）。','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'同意支持团队进行诊断','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'记录管理员同意随支持工单发送诊断信息。','Read the site diagnostics'=>'阅读站点诊断','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'返回支持工单通常包含的诊断信息：版本、已启用的插件、配额限制以及最近的错误。','Open a support ticket'=>'提交支持工单','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'提交一张支持工单（主题、消息、类型、电子邮件），并在管理员同意时附带此站点的诊断信息。它绝不会创建或发送登录凭据。','Start the free Pro trial'=>'开始免费 Pro 试用','Starts the 14-day Tranzly Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'为此站点开启为期 14 天的 Tranzly Pro 试用（无需付款）。','Read the Tranzly 2.x import'=>'读取 Tranzly 2.x 导入','Returns the state and report of importing translations from Tranzly 2.x.'=>'返回从 Tranzly 2.x 导入翻译的状态和报告。','Import Tranzly 2.x translations'=>'导入 Tranzly 2.x 翻译','Runs the 2.x import: dry-run (report only), run, or undo.'=>'运行 2.x 导入：预演（仅报告）、运行或撤销。','Translate an image\'s text'=>'翻译图像文本','Saves an image\'s alt text, title or caption (field) in a language (lang).'=>'保存指定语言（lang）下图像的替代文本、标题或说明（field）。','Read the menus per language'=>'按语言阅读菜单','Returns which menu each language shows in each menu location.'=>'返回每种语言在各个菜单位置显示的菜单。','Set the menus per language'=>'按语言设置菜单','Assigns a menu per language per location (map).'=>'为每种语言的每个位置分配一个菜单（映射）。','Protect or unlock a translation'=>'保护或解锁翻译','Protects a translation from being overwritten by the engine (protected: true), or unlocks it.'=>'保护翻译不被引擎覆盖（protected: true），或将其解锁。','Read a quality report (Pro)'=>'阅读质量报告 (Pro)','Returns a translation\'s AI quality report: score and the segments it flagged.'=>'返回翻译的 AI 质量报告：分数及被标记的片段。','Approve or reject a translation (Pro)'=>'批准或拒绝翻译 (Pro)','Approves a translation (and publishes it when the original is published) or sends it back (decision, note).'=>'批准翻译（并在原文发布时予以发布）或退回（决定、备注）。','Read a translation side by side'=>'并排阅读翻译','Returns a translation\'s segments beside the original\'s, for review and correction.'=>'返回翻译片段并将其置于原文旁边，以供审核和更正。','Correct a translation'=>'修正翻译','Saves corrected segments of a translation (segments: key to text); corrected text is protected from re-translation.'=>'保存翻译中已更正的片段（片段：键到文本）；已更正的文本将受到保护，避免被重新翻译。','Unlink a post from its translations'=>'取消文章与其翻译的关联','Takes a post out of its translation group; it keeps its language.'=>'将文章移出其翻译分组；文章将保留其原有语言。','Read a post\'s translations'=>'读取文章翻译','Lists a post\'s translation group: every language\'s member with its title, status and edit link.'=>'列出文章的翻译分组：每种语言的成员及其标题、状态和编辑链接。','Create an empty translation'=>'创建空白翻译','Creates a draft translation of a post in a language (lang) to write by hand, without an engine.'=>'为文章创建某种语言（lang）的翻译草稿，以便您手动编写，无需翻译引擎。','Link an existing post as a translation'=>'将现有文章关联为翻译','Makes an existing post (target) the translation of this post in a language.'=>'将现有文章（目标）设为此文章的某种语言翻译。','Check translations with AI (Pro)'=>'使用 AI 检查翻译 (Pro)','Schedules the AI quality check of the next page of a language\'s translations (or the given posts).'=>'计划对某种语言的下一页翻译（或指定的文章）进行 AI 质量检查。','Multilingual SEO audit (Pro)'=>'多语言 SEO 审计 (Pro)','Checks translations for missing SEO titles, descriptions, slugs and hreflang in a language, page by page.'=>'逐页检查特定语言的翻译中是否缺少 SEO 标题、说明、别名（slug）和 hreflang。','Change languages and settings'=>'更改语言和设置','Sets the site\'s languages (languages: list of code and name; the first is the original language), the front-end class prefix, and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'设置网站语言（语言：代码和名称列表；第一项为原始语言）、前端类名前缀，以及是否允许使用 AI 代理（MCP）。','Read theme and plugin texts'=>'读取主题和插件文本','Returns the theme and plugin texts (scope) in a language with their translations.'=>'返回某种语言的主题和插件文本（范围）及其翻译。','Translate missing theme and plugin texts'=>'翻译缺失的主题和插件文本','Translates the next page of untranslated theme and plugin texts in a language with the default engine (repeat with after until done).'=>'使用默认引擎将某种语言中未翻译的主题和插件文本的下一页进行翻译（使用 after 重复此操作直至完成）。','Correct theme and plugin texts'=>'更正主题和插件文本','Saves corrected translations of theme and plugin texts (strings); they become protected.'=>'保存主题和插件文本（字符串）的已更正翻译；它们将受到保护。','Translate what is missing'=>'翻译缺失的内容','Queues translation of every missing (or out-of-date) item in a language and post type.'=>'将指定语言和文章类型中每个缺失（或过时）的项目加入翻译队列。','List what is missing or out of date'=>'列出缺失或过时的内容','Lists originals with their translation state in a language (state: missing, stale, current), page by page.'=>'逐页列出原文及其在某种语言中的翻译状态（状态：缺失、过期、当前）。','Read the site\'s texts in a language'=>'以某种语言阅读网站文本','Returns the site title, tagline and widget texts in a language.'=>'以某种语言返回站点标题、副标题和微件文本。','Translate a site text'=>'翻译网站文本','Saves one site text (key) in a language, e.g. the site title or tagline.'=>'以某种语言保存单个站点文本（键），例如站点标题或副标题。','Translate a category or tag'=>'翻译分类或标签','Translates one term (category, tag or product attribute) into a language (lang) with an engine, creating or updating its translation.'=>'使用引擎将一个分类术语（分类、标签或产品属性）翻译为某种语言（lang），并创建或更新其翻译。','Unlink a term from its translations'=>'取消词条与其翻译的关联','Takes a term out of its translation group.'=>'将术语移出其翻译分组。','Read a term\'s translations'=>'读取术语翻译','Lists a category\'s or tag\'s translation group.'=>'列出分类或标签的翻译组。','Create a term translation by hand'=>'手动创建术语翻译','Creates a term\'s translation in a language with a name, slug and description you give.'=>'使用您提供的名称、别名和描述创建某个语言的分类项目翻译。','Link an existing term as a translation'=>'将现有术语链接为翻译','Makes an existing term (target) the translation of this term in a language.'=>'将现有术语（目标）设为此术语在某种语言下的翻译。','List theme and plugin text sources (Pro)'=>'列出主题和插件文本来源 (Pro)','Lists the themes and plugins whose texts can be scanned for translation, and how many strings each has.'=>'列出可以扫描文本以供翻译的主题和插件，以及每个主题和插件包含的字符串数量。','Scan a theme or plugin for texts (Pro)'=>'扫描主题或插件中的文本 (Pro)','Scans the next page of a component\'s PHP files for translatable texts (repeat with after until done).'=>'扫描组件 PHP 文件的下一页以查找可翻译的文本（使用 after 重复此操作直至完成）。','Read the address settings'=>'读取地址设置','Returns how languages appear in addresses (folder, subdomain or domain), translated slugs and bases, and noindex for untranslated pages.'=>'返回语言在地址中的显示方式（文件夹、子域名或域名）、已翻译的别名和基础路径，以及未翻译页面的 noindex 设置。','Change the address settings'=>'更改地址设置','Sets the address mode (mode), per-language domains, translated bases and segments, noindex_untranslated and slug suggestions.'=>'设置地址模式 (mode)、各语言域名、翻译的基础和片段、noindex_untranslated 以及别名建议。','Estimate translating the site (Pro)'=>'估算网站翻译 (Pro)','Estimates a whole-site translation in a language (post_types, scope, engine) before starting it.'=>'在开始之前，预估全站某种语言的翻译（post_types、scope、engine）。','Read the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'阅读工作流程设置 (Pro)','Returns auto-translation on publish and on update, review before publish, and the AI quality check\'s threshold, provider and model.'=>'返回发布和更新时的自动翻译、发布前的审查，以及 AI 质量检查的阈值、提供商和模型。','Change the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'更改工作流程设置 (Pro)','Sets on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider and quality_model.'=>'设置 on_update (off, stale, translate)、on_publish、review、quality_threshold、quality_provider 和 quality_model。','Translate the whole site'=>'翻译整个网站','Starts background translation jobs for every original of the given content types (all translated types when none are given): the missing translations, the out-of-date ones, or all of them. Returns the jobs started, one per language.'=>'为指定内容类型的每个原始内容启动后台翻译任务（未指定时则为所有已翻译类型）：缺失的翻译、过期的翻译或全部翻译。返回已启动的任务，每种语言一个。','Check a translation with AI'=>'使用 AI 检查翻译','Has AI compare one translation with its original and score it, and stores the report on the translation. Uses the quality-check AI model set in Tranzly\'s workflow settings.'=>'让 AI 将翻译与原文进行比对并评分，并将报告存储在该翻译中。使用在 Tranzly 的工作流设置中指定的质量检查 AI 模型。','The translation\'s post ID (see tranzly/translation-status).'=>'翻译的文章 ID（请参阅 tranzly/translation-status）。','Export a file for human translators'=>'为人工翻译导出文件','Returns an XLIFF or CSV file (as text) with the originals and their translations in one language, for a translator or a translation agency: the given posts, or a page of up to 100 originals of a content type in a state (missing, stale, translated or all; repeat with after). Import it back with tranzly/upload-translation-file.'=>'为译员或翻译机构返回包含原文及其单一语言译文的 XLIFF 或 CSV 文件（文本格式）：指定的文章，或处于某种状态（missing、stale、translated 或 all；使用 after 重复）的某种内容类型最多 100 个原文的页面。使用 tranzly/upload-translation-file 将其重新导入。','Words never translated (brand and product names).'=>'从不翻译的词（品牌和产品名称）。','Per language code: source term => the translation always used.'=>'按语言代码：源术语 => 始终使用的翻译。','Per language code: formality (default, more, less) and style instructions.'=>'按语言代码：正式程度（默认、更高、更低）和风格指南。','Read the glossary'=>'阅读词汇表','Returns the words never translated, the fixed term translations and the tone per language.'=>'返回从不翻译的词语、固定术语的翻译以及每种语言的语气。','Update the glossary'=>'更新词汇表','Replaces the parts of the glossary you send (words never translated, term translations, tone); parts you leave out are kept. Used by every engine from the next translation on.'=>'替换您发送的术语表部分（绝不翻译的词、术语翻译、语气）；您未包含的部分将被保留。从下一次翻译开始供所有引擎使用。','Language suggestion'=>'语言建议','This page is also available in %s.'=>'此页面也有 %s 版本。','Read it in %s'=>'以%s阅读','No thanks'=>'不，谢谢','Choose how languages appear in your addresses: a folder, a subdomain, a separate domain or a query parameter.'=>'选择语言在您的地址中的显示方式：文件夹、子域名、独立域名或查询参数。','Subdomains and separate domains per language are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'每种语言的子域和独立域是 Tranzly Pro 的一部分。','The language folders must be a list.'=>'语言文件夹必须是一个列表。','"%s" cannot be a language folder. Use 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens, different for every language, and not a word WordPress already uses.'=>'“%s”不能作为语言文件夹。请使用 2 到 12 个小写字母、数字或连字符，每种语言各不相同，且不能是 WordPress 已使用的词语。','The domains must be a list.'=>'域名必须是列表。','"%s" is not a domain name, such as example.de.'=>'“%s”不是域名，例如 example.de。','Each language needs its own domain.'=>'每种语言都需要有自己的域名。','The translated address words must be a list.'=>'翻译后的地址词必须是一个列表。','The translated address words must be listed per language.'=>'翻译后的地址词语必须按语言列出。','"%s" cannot be used in an address. Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'“%s”不能用于地址中。请使用小写字母、数字和连字符。','This setting is on or off.'=>'此设置处于开启或关闭状态。','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'在搜索引擎中隐藏未翻译的页面是 Tranzly Pro 的一部分。','Languages (as a submenu)'=>'语言','Languages (side by side)'=>'语言（并排）','Add to Menu'=>'添加至菜单','On your site, this item shows the site\'s languages, each linking to the current page in that language.'=>'在您的站点上，此项目会显示站点的语言，每种语言均链接到该语言的当前页面。','%1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d)','Links to this page in each of your languages.'=>'指向此页面各种语言版本的链接。','Language name'=>'语言名称','Language code'=>'语言代码','Name and code'=>'名称与代码','Design'=>'设计','Show each language as'=>'将每种语言显示为','Show flags (a flag is a country, not a language)'=>'显示国旗（旗帜代表国家，而非语言）','List'=>'列表','Pills'=>'药丸','Buttons'=>'按钮','Dropdown'=>'下拉菜单','Language codes'=>'语言代码','Flags'=>'标记','Include the current language'=>'包含当前语言','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'隐藏未翻译此页面的语言','Stack vertically'=>'纵向堆叠','Accessible label'=>'无障碍标签','Text'=>'文本','Background'=>'背景','Current language text'=>'当前语言文本','Current language background'=>'当前语言背景','Border'=>'边框','Corner radius'=>'圆角半径','Space between languages'=>'语言间距','Text size'=>'文字大小','Switcher'=>'切换器','(no title)'=>'(无标题)','There is nothing to fix here.'=>'此处没有需要修复的内容。','No content type is translated on this site.'=>'此站点上未翻译任何内容类型。','That content type is not translated on this site.'=>'该内容类型在此网站上未翻译。','There is nothing to translate in that selection.'=>'该选定内容中没有可翻译的内容。','Choose at least one language to translate into.'=>'请至少选择一种要翻译的目标语言。','You are not allowed to export translations.'=>'您没有权限导出翻译。','Choose an XLIFF or CSV file to import.'=>'选择要导入的 XLIFF 或 CSV 文件。','That is not a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file. Export one first, 