scribe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'请描述发生了什么。您可以自行选择是否附带站点信息，并且可以先确切查看其包含的内容。','Tell us what to build'=>'告诉我们您希望构建什么','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'发送想法、功能请求或任何反馈。它会直接传达给团队。','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'这需要几分钟时间，并将设置 %s，使其在此站点上立即生效。您稍后可以更改所有内容。','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'您已准备就绪。如果有任何功能未按预期运行，我们只需一次点击即可为您提供帮助。','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'第 %1$d 步（共 %2$d 步）：%3$s','Finish'=>'完成','Skip setup'=>'跳过设置','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'由 Zinn Digital® Ltd 首席执行官 Neil Lock 构建','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','Tranzly website'=>'Tranzly 网站','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® 网站','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'查看 Pro 方案与定价','Languages'=>'语言','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'第一种语言是撰写您内容的语言。访客可以使用语言切换器区块进行切换。','(default)'=>'(默认)','Find a language'=>'查找语言','Type its name in your language or in its own, then choose it. The code and name below fill in by themselves.'=>'用您的语言或它本身的语言键入其名称，然后选择它。下面的代码和名称将自动填充。','Locale code'=>'区域设置代码','For example fr_FR'=>'例如 fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'名称（可选）','For example Français'=>'例如 Français','Add language'=>'添加语言','Front-end output'=>'前端输出','Class name prefix'=>'类名前缀','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'插件在您的页面上输出的每个类名都以此前缀开头，这样页面就不会透露是哪个插件构建了它们。1 到 8 个小写字母或数字，以字母开头。','Beta updates'=>'测试版更新','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'该站点接收 Beta 测试版本作为更新。','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'此站点仅接收稳定版本。','Change this on the Account page'=>'请在“账户”页面上更改此项','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Beta 版本仅向已连接到其账户的授权 Pro 安装提供。连接后，您即可从“账户”页面加入。','Save settings'=>'保存设置','First engine that is set up'=>'配置的第一个引擎','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'密钥已保存。该密钥已被加密存储，且不会再次显示。','Engine settings saved.'=>'引擎设置已保存。','Glossary saved.'=>'术语表已保存。','Your keys'=>'您的密钥','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly 使用您自己的账户调用翻译服务。密钥以加密形式存储在您的数据库中，且仅会发送至其所属的服务。AI 模型密钥在 AI 设置中进行配置。','%s API key'=>'%s API 密钥','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'已保存：%s。输入新密钥以替换，或保存空字段以将其删除。','No key saved.'=>'未保存任何密钥。','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Azure 区域（全局资源请留空）','Save key'=>'保存密钥','Check my DeepL usage'=>'检查我的 DeepL 使用情况','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'本账单周期已使用 %2$s 个字符中的 %1$s 个。','Which engine translates'=>'哪个引擎负责翻译','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'尚未设置任何引擎。请在上方保存密钥（或设置 AI 模型）以开始翻译。','Default engine'=>'默认引擎','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'为每种语言配置不同的引擎、自动备用方案以及月度支出上限是 Tranzly Pro 的功能。','Glossary and words never translated'=>'词汇表及绝不翻译的词语','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'切勿翻译这些词语（每行一个）','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'在所有引擎中，品牌和产品名称均完全保持原样。','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'针对每种语言的首选翻译和语气是 Tranzly Pro 的功能。','Save glossary'=>'保存术语表','Settings'=>'设置','Translation engine'=>'翻译引擎','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Tranzly 在此站点上翻译的内容','found, translated with your content'=>'已找到，已随您的内容一起翻译','not on this site'=>'不在本站点','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beav