ated'=>'已翻译','Edited by a person'=>'由人工编辑','Machine translated'=>'机器翻译','Waiting for review'=>'等待审核','Needs a human look'=>'需要人工检查','Everything'=>'全部','Up to date'=>'最新','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly 仍在确定哪些较旧的翻译已过期。在此过程中，“已过期”的数量将会增加。','Content type'=>'内容类型','All content'=>'所有内容','Average quality'=>'平均质量','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'已翻译 %1$d 个 (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'显示','Translate everything missing'=>'翻译所有缺失的内容','Update everything out of date'=>'更新所有过期的项目','Check the quality with AI'=>'使用 AI 检查质量','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'重新翻译低分页面','Nothing here.'=>'这里没有内容。','Quality'=>'质量','by a person'=>'由人工','waiting for review'=>'等待审核','Show more'=>'显示更多','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'批量翻译整个网站 (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'借助 Tranzly Pro，选择内容类型和语言，查看预估并一次性翻译整个网站。','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'已启动 %d 个后台任务，每种语言一个。您可以在“翻译任务”中跟踪它们。','Content types'=>'内容类型','What to translate'=>'要翻译的内容','Only what is missing'=>'仅缺失的内容','Only what is out of date'=>'仅过期的内容','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'全部（由人工编辑的页面保持原样）','Estimate'=>'预估','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'%1$d 个页面，%2$s 个字符。此引擎不公开价格。','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'%1$d 个页面，%2$s 个字符，约 $%3$s。','Find a text'=>'查找文本','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'还有 %d 个：在“Find a text”中键入以缩小列表范围。','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'位于每个页面角落的小按钮，适用于任何主题，无需任何设置。','Off'=>'关闭','Bottom corner, end side'=>'底角，末端','Bottom corner, start side'=>'底角，起始边','Top corner, end side'=>'顶角，末端','Top corner, start side'=>'顶部角落，起始侧','Switcher around the content'=>'内容周围的切换器','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'为每篇文章和页面添加切换器','Before the content'=>'在内容之前','After the content'=>'内容之后','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'添加切换器的其他方式','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'区块编辑器和站点编辑器：包含五种设计的“语言切换器”区块。','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich：“语言切换器”元素。','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'菜单：外观 → 菜单 → “语言切换器”框。','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'侧边栏：“语言切换器”小部件。','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'在其他任何地方，短代码：','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor 和 Bricks：每个生成器中的“语言切换器”小部件。','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Elementor 和 Bricks 小部件是 Tranzly Pro 的一部分。','Save'=>'保存','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'每种语言一个文件夹：example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'每种语言一个子域名：de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'每个语言使用单独的域名：example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'查询参数：example.com/?lang=de（较旧的站点）','Category'=>'分类','Tag'=>'标签','Product'=>'产品','Product category'=>'产品分类','Product tag'=>'产品标签','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'已保存。您的语言地址已更改，如下所示。','Language in the address'=>'地址中的语言','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'访问者和搜索引擎如何访问每种语言','Address word for %s'=>'%s 的称谓','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'默认语言的地址中不包含任何词语。','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'%s 的域名（可选）','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'请先将域名指向此站点。没有域名的语言将使用您主域名上的文件夹。','Where each language lives now'=>'现在各语言所在的位置','Translated address words'=>'已翻译的地址词','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'页面和文章地址来自其翻译后的标题。在此处您翻译固定词，因此 /de/kategorie/ 会替换 /de/category/。','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s（现为“%2$s”）','Search engines and visitors'=>'搜索引擎与访客','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'通过小型横幅为访客提供其母语（绝不自动重定向）','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'向搜索引擎隐藏未翻译的页面 (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'仍保留原始内容的翻译将被排除在搜索结果之外，直到其被翻译为止。','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Tranzly Pro 的一部分。','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly 会将 hreflang 链接（包含 x-default）、页面语言和文本方向以及每种语言添加到您的站点地图中：','Working together with: %s.'=>'正在与此协作：%s。','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'每个地址词包含 2 到 12 个小写字母、数字或连字符。','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'更新时自动翻译、审校员角色、供译员使用的 XLIFF 导出、从 WPML、Polylang 或 TranslatePress 迁移以及 AI 质量检查均随 Tranzly Pro 提供。','When an original changes'=>'当原始文件更改时','When a page is edited'=>'当页面被编辑时','Mark its translations out of date'=>'将其翻译标记为已过期','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'在后台再次翻译其译文','Do nothing'=>'不执行任何操作','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'经人工编辑的翻译绝不会被覆盖；而是会被标记为已过期。','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'在发布新页面时将其翻译成每种语言','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'第二个 AI 模型会在原文旁阅读每项翻译，为其评分并指出错误。它会使用您在 AI 设置中提供的个人 AI 密钥。请从“翻译状态”开始检查。','AI provider'=>'AI 提供商','The AI settings’ general model'=>'AI 设置的通用模型','Recommended'=>'推荐','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'得分低于此数值的页面需要人工审核','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'仅发布经过审校人员批准的翻译','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'为用户分配翻译员角色（可编辑翻译，不能编辑原文，无法发布）或翻译审校员角色（亦可批准）。审校人员还可以在“待审”下的文章和页面列表中找到所有待处理的内容；在该处发布即可批准。','Manage users'=>'管理用户','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'没有等待审核的项目。','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'给翻译人员的备注（可选）','Read side by side'=>'并排阅读','Approve'=>'批准','Ask for changes'=>'请求更改','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'已导入 %d 条翻译并已保护免受机器翻译影响。','Export and import for translators'=>'为翻译人员导出和导入','Not translated yet'=>'尚未翻译','Already translated'=>'已翻译','Format'=>'格式','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2（翻译工具）','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV（电子表格）','Download the file'=>'下载文件','Import a translated file'=>'导入翻译文件','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'已撤销：%1$d 个链接已移除，%2$d 个导入的页面已删除。','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'空运行，未做任何更改：','Imported:'=>'已导入：','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'已添加 %1$d 种语言，已关联 %2$d 条翻译，已构建 %3$d 个页面，%4$d 处文本。','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'请先关闭另一个插件（其地址和切换器会与 Tranzly 冲突）。其数据将保留在原处，因此您可以随时切换回来；“撤销”操作会完全移除导入所添加的内容。','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'此站点上没有来自此插件的数据。','Languages: %s'=>'语言：%s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'仍处于启用状态：请先将其关闭。','Dry run'=>'空运行','Import'=>'导入','Undo the import'=>'撤销导入','Comments and product reviews'=>'评论与产品评价','Each language keeps its own'=>'每种语言保留其自身的内容','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'显示每个版本中每种语言的评论','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'全部显示，已翻译为读者的语言','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'翻译会对每条已批准的评论使用您的翻译引擎。垃圾评论和等待审核的评论绝不会被发送。','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'已保存。您更改的部分已标记为经人工检查，且此翻译受保护以防被机器翻译覆盖。','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'此翻译的版式已在编辑器中更改，因此某些部分不再与原文配对。没有配对的部分显示为空白；请在编辑器中编辑其余部分。','Open the editor'=>'打开编辑器','Original (%s)'=>'原始 (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'翻译 (%s)','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Open in the editor'=>'在编辑器中打开','Checked by a person'=>'经人工检查','Imported'=>'已导入','Not in the translation'=>'不在翻译中','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'在管理菜单的 Tranzly 下添加第二语言，切换器就会显示在此处。','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'默认关闭：国旗代表国家，而非语言。','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'屏幕阅读器朗读的内容，例如“选择语言”。','Colours'=>'颜色','Not translated'=>'未翻译','Original'=>'原始','Published'=>'已发布','Draft'=>'草稿','Checked by a person, protected'=>'经人工检查，受保护','Imported, protected'=>'已导入，受保护','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'尚未翻译（副本）','View'=>'查看','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'解锁以便能够再次翻译','Protect'=>'保护','Publish the translations'=>'发布翻译','Translate into %d language'=>'翻译成 %d 种语言','Show this block'=>'显示此区块','In every language'=>'支持每种语言','Only in the languages ticked'=>'仅在勾选的语言中','In every language except those ticked'=>'除已勾选的语言外，适用于所有语言','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'允许使用 AI 代理。请重新加载此页面以查看工具。','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'AI 代理已关闭。它们的连接地址不再响应。','Image per language'=>'每种语言的图像','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'为某种语言的读者显示另一张图片，例如包含文字的横幅。','Replace the %s image'=>'替换 %s 图像','Choose a %s image'=>'选择%s图片','Use the original image'=>'使用原始图像','Engine for %s'=>'用于 %s 的引擎','The default engine'=>'默认引擎','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'如果引擎失败或达到限制，请按此顺序尝试以下各项','Monthly spending caps'=>'每月支出上限','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'当引擎达到上限时，下个月之前将不再向其发送任何内容，失败的翻译报告会说明原因。留空表示无限制。','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s（本月已花费：$%2$s）','Save caps'=>'保存权限','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'首选翻译（每行一个：术语 = 翻译）','Formality'=>'正式度','Default'=>'默认','Formal'=>'正式','Informal'=>'非正式','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'风格指南（受众、品牌基调）','Correct this translation'=>'修正此翻译','Saving…'=>'正在保存…','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'已翻译文本。按 Enter 键进行修正。','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'点击任何带有边框的文本以更正其翻译。','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'在此页面上未找到可在此处编辑的已翻译文本。请改用并排编辑器。','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'语言切换器','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'指向站点每种语言版本的此页面的链接。在列出两种或更多语言之前，不呈现任何内容。','block keywordlanguage'=>'语言','block keywordswitcher'=>'切换器','block keywordtranslation'=>'翻译','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'允许访问者使用您的另一种语言阅读此页面：列表、胶囊按钮、按钮、下拉菜单或语言代码，带有可选的旗帜。','block keywordmultilingual'=>'多语言']];